<h2>How does breathing fit with wearable tracking?</h2>
<p><strong>Keep a note that you tried the exercise</strong>, and compare it with your own sleep and routine notes.</p>
<p>That's an observation, not a controlled experiment. A change on the same day can't show that breathing caused it.</p>

